# Content writer voice

Before writing or editing any visitor-facing text, read `content_voice_checklist.md` and run the whole list.

Write as ClementFranz in first person. The site should sound like a person making a portfolio, not like an AI explaining or hiding the work.

Put replacement copy in `content_for_developer.md` for the developer agent. Do not put helper notes, file paths, or process language on the public page.
